OL,3,ANew Zealand heads to polls
OL,4,
OL,5,FNew Zealanders are heading to the polls
OL,6,Fto elect a new government three years
OL,7,Fafter the last election
OL,9,FNearly 3.8 million people have enrolled
OL,10,Fto vote with more than 40% of that
OL,11,Fnumber having already cast their
OL,12,Fballots before election day
OL,14,FNew Zealand's electoral system, known
OL,15,Fas Mixed Member Proportional (MMP),
OL,16,Fsees people cast two votes - one for a
OL,17,Fcandidate and the other for a political
OL,18,Fparty
OL,20,FThere has only been one majority
OL,21,Fgovernment under the system which was
OL,22,Fintroduced in 1996
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
